                <head>No. 34<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>For text of an agreement relating to economic cooperation between the United
                    States and the Republic of China, effected by an exchange of notes signed at
                    Taipei on June 25, 1952, see TIAS 2657 or 3 UST (pt. 4) 4846.</p>
